7.2 Advantages
The proposed system provides several advantages:

Reduces manual classification.

Saves support-team time.

Provides consistent classification.

Improves automated ticket routing.

Reduces initial processing effort.

Makes workflow execution easier to monitor.

Allows classification rules to be modified as requirements change.

7.3 Limitations
Possible limitations include:

Keyword-based classification may not understand complex descriptions.

Similar keywords may have different meanings in different contexts.

Incorrect or incomplete ticket information can affect classification.

Large classification rule sets may require careful maintenance.

7.4 Future Enhancements
Future versions could include:

AI/ML-based ticket classification.

Natural language processing.

Automatic priority prediction.

Sentiment analysis.

Automatic assignment based on agent availability.

Integration with knowledge articles.

Automatic recommendation of solutions.

Analytics dashboards for classification accuracy.

